{
  "$schema": "./contract.schema.json",
  "id": "antd.avatar",
  "name": "Avatar",
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "status": "draft",
  "description": "Subject: antd@5.29.3 (pinned, examples/antd/PROVENANCE.md). CURATED seed for the antd P2 exam (code→canvas, held out) — props/axes only; anatomy is promoted from captured DOM truth. Every axis value is the library's own declared enum (antd spells them as `readonly [...]` tuples; seed-gen reads them once its declaration lookup ignores directory case — W1, examples/antd/RECON.md §4). ATOM, SIZE×SHAPE (the MUI Avatar precedent plus antd's real size enum small|default|large → 24/32/40px). The text child is ONE glyph on purpose: antd's text-fit ResizeObserver writes an inline `transform: scale(n)` on span.ant-avatar-string (scale(1) for a single initial; a T3 dynamic channel if the initial overflowed). NAMED OUT: `icon` (child SWAP — replaces the string part), `src`, numeric `size`, `gap`. COMPUTED-ENRICHED (extract/computed): unlabeled styled channels minted from computed-style capture of antd@5.29.3 in headless Chromium 151.0.7922.34; overflow channels in the sibling extension file. FLOOR-PROMOTED (examples/antd/scripts/promote-floor.mjs): enriched.contract.json — computed-capture truth; minted leaves source-aliased to Ant Design's own CSS-variable references where verified (source-bindings.json); extension sidecar carries the named overflow.",
  "semantics": {
    "element": "span"
  },
  "props": [
    {
      "name": "size",
      "type": {
        "enum": [
          "small",
          "default",
          "large"
        ]
      },
      "default": "default",
      "bindings": {
        "figma": {
          "kind": "VARIANT",
          "property": "Size",
          "values": {
            "small": "Small",
            "default": "Default",
            "large": "Large"
          }
        },
        "code": {
          "prop": "size"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "shape",
      "type": {
        "enum": [
          "circle",
          "square"
        ]
      },
      "default": "circle",
      "bindings": {
        "figma": {
          "kind": "VARIANT",
          "property": "Shape",
          "values": {
            "circle": "Circle",
            "square": "Square"
          }
        },
        "code": {
          "prop": "shape"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "children",
      "type": "text",
      "default": "A",
      "bindings": {
        "figma": {
          "kind": "TEXT",
          "property": "Initial"
        },
        "code": {
          "prop": "children"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "states": [],
  "anatomy": {
    "root": {
      "layout": {
        "display": "flex",
        "align": "center",
        "justify": "center"
      },
      "parts": {
        "label": {
          "content": {
            "prop": "children"
          },
          "description": "Promoted from the computed floor (round 4): rendered anatomy span|avatar-string — this element exists in the real component's DOM; the static layer had no part for it.",
          "declared": {
            "display": "block",
            "box-sizing": "border-box",
            "font-family": "Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif",
            "text-align": "center",
            "text-wrap-mode": "nowrap",
            "transform": "matrix(1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0)"
          },
          "tokens": {
            "color": "{imported.avatar.label.color}",
            "font-size": "{imported.avatar.label.font-size}",
            "font-weight": "{imported.avatar.label.font-weight}",
            "line-height": "{imported.avatar.label.line-height}"
          }
        }
      },
      "declared": {
        "border-bottom-style": "solid",
        "border-left-style": "solid",
        "border-right-style": "solid",
        "border-top-style": "solid",
        "box-sizing": "border-box",
        "font-family": "Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif",
        "overflow-x": "hidden",
        "overflow-y": "hidden",
        "position": "relative",
        "text-align": "center",
        "text-wrap-mode": "nowrap"
      },
      "tokens": {
        "background-color": "{imported.avatar.root.background-color}",
        "border-bottom-color": "{imported.shared.color-00000000}",
        "border-bottom-left-radius": "{imported.avatar.root.border-bottom-left-radius.{size}.{shape}}",
        "border-bottom-right-radius": "{imported.avatar.root.border-bottom-right-radius.{size}.{shape}}",
        "border-bottom-width": "{imported.shared.size-1}",
        "border-left-color": "{imported.shared.color-00000000}",
        "border-left-width": "{imported.shared.size-1}",
        "border-right-color": "{imported.shared.color-00000000}",
        "border-right-width": "{imported.shared.size-1}",
        "border-top-color": "{imported.shared.color-00000000}",
        "border-top-left-radius": "{imported.avatar.root.border-top-left-radius.{size}.{shape}}",
        "border-top-right-radius": "{imported.avatar.root.border-top-right-radius.{size}.{shape}}",
        "border-top-width": "{imported.shared.size-1}",
        "bottom": "{imported.shared.size-0}",
        "color": "{imported.avatar.root.color}",
        "font-size": "{imported.avatar.root.font-size}",
        "left": "{imported.shared.size-0}",
        "line-height": "{imported.avatar.root.line-height}",
        "right": "{imported.shared.size-0}",
        "top": "{imported.shared.size-0}"
      }
    }
  },
  "bindings": {
    "figma": {
      "anchors": {
        "fileKey": null,
        "componentSetKey": null
      }
    },
    "code": {
      "anchors": {
        "importPath": "antd",
        "export": "Avatar"
      }
    }
  }
}
